OL,3,GNEWSASuper sewer is cleaning up the
OL,4,AThames, says report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe health of the River Thames in
OL,7,FLondon improved significantly in the
OL,8,Ffirst year of the new "super sewer",
OL,9,Faccording to Thames Water.
OL,11,FA report by the company found an 86%
OL,12,Freduction in raw sewage entering the
OL,13,Friver in 2025 compared with the
OL,14,Fprevious average, while the sewer also
OL,15,Fprevented about 84 tonnes of litter,
OL,16,Fsuch as wet wipes and sanitary
OL,17,Fproducts, from reaching the waterway.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
