OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASuper sewer is cleaning up the
OL,4,AThames, says report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sewer, called the Thames Tideway
OL,7,FTunnel, was built to increase capacity,
OL,8,Fallowing more rainwater and waste to be
OL,9,Fstored and reducing overflows into the
OL,10,Ftidal stretch of the Thames.
OL,12,FHowever, the report warned that
OL,13,Fpollution and climate change remained
OL,14,F"big challenges" and said continued
OL,15,Faction was needed.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
